WEBVTT

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.960
but they do have one, like, big nail.

00:08:31.984 --> 00:08:33.278
(Audience laughter)

00:08:33.302 --> 00:08:36.279
You can't really see too clear.
The fur's kind of grown over.

00:08:36.303 --> 00:08:39.279
But they use their tails a lot,
especially in rut.

00:08:40.198 --> 00:08:45.976
He will urinate and spin his tail
to spread the urine around

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.976
and make him more attractive.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.096
I don't know why that would be,
but it works for them.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.615
So, what the hell.

00:08:53.639 --> 00:08:54.976
(Audience laughter)

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:59.769
Now, they will also defecate
in certain areas.

00:08:59.793 --> 00:09:02.368
Generally, they poop
wherever they want to,